// Build settings of the CapCollector target (CAP-104): no personal values in the tracked project. The signing team
// comes from Local.xcconfig next to this file (gitignored; copy Local.xcconfig.example and put your Apple Team ID).
// Without it the project still builds for the simulator, but Xcode asks for a team before signing for a device.
// CAPACITOR_DEBUG (Debug) still comes from ../debug.xcconfig at the project level.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
